# 🤖 Smart Git Scan - AI GitHub Portfolio Reviewer

An AI-powered GitHub portfolio analysis tool that helps developers evaluate and improve their GitHub presence using Generative AI.

## 🚀 Overview

Smart Git Scan analyzes a developer's GitHub profile and provides intelligent insights about repositories, technologies, coding activity, and portfolio quality.

The goal of this project is to help students and developers understand how strong their GitHub portfolio is and what improvements can make it more professional.

## ✨ Features

* 🔍 GitHub profile analysis
* 📂 Repository insights
* 🛠 Technology and skill detection
* ⭐ Portfolio quality evaluation
* 📊 AI-generated portfolio score
* 💡 Personalized improvement suggestions
* 🤖 Generative AI powered feedback
* 📈 Developer growth recommendations

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

* Frontend: React / Modern Web UI
* Backend: API Integration
* Generative AI: Gemini API
* GitHub API
* JavaScript / TypeScript

## 🎯 Problem Statement

Many students and developers create projects on GitHub but struggle with:

* Improving their repository quality
* Writing better documentation
* Understanding missing skills
* Building a recruiter-friendly portfolio

Smart Git Scan provides AI-based guidance to improve their online developer presence.

## ⚙️ Installation & Setup

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/mallikarajapure-collab/smart-git-scan.git
```

Navigate to the project folder:

```bash
cd smart-git-scan
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

Run the application:

```bash
npm run dev
```

